{"name":"Malaga","hex":"#ab5871","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Malaga","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A port city, the capital of the province of Malaga, Andalusia, Spain.","A province of Andalusia, Spain, around the city."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Malaga"}],"entries":[{"title":"Málaga","blocks":[{"text":"Málaga is a municipality of Spain and the capital of the province of Málaga, in the autonomous community of Andalusia. With a population of 592,346 in 2024, it is the 2nd-largest city in Andalusia and the 6th-largest in the country. It lies in Southern Iberia on the Costa del Sol of the Mediterranean, primarily on the left bank of the Guadalhorce. The urban core originally developed in the space between the Gibralfaro Hill and the Guadalmedina."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Da_Gibralfaro_%28cropped%292.jpg/330px-Da_Gibralfaro_%28cropped%292.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%A1laga","wikidata":"Q8851"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Torrecatedralypalmeras.jpg/500px-Torrecatedralypalmeras.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Torrecatedralypalmeras.jpg/500px-Torrecatedralypalmeras.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATorrecatedralypalmeras.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Cenachero_edited.jpg/500px-Cenachero_edited.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bf/Cenachero_edited.jpg/1280px-Cenachero_edited.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia